# Family Number Input — keypad that builds a number shown as per-digit Animated.Text
# with FadeInDown/FadeOutDown + LinearTransition, thousands separators, and a row
# that scales down as it grows; backspace deletes, long-press backspace resets.
# What this test covers: typing 1..7 so separators appear (1,234,567); leading
# zero at 0 (stays 0); backspace one digit at a time across a separator;
# typing past the 11-digit cap (extra digits ignored, row at min scale);
# long-press backspace reset from 11 digits (all digits exit at once); rapid
# typing and rapid backspacing past zero while layout transitions are running.
# Keys are pressed by position (cols x 70/200/330; rows y 494/582/669/756)
# because the display digits share the same text labels as the keys.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/family-number-input"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1000
# 0 at 0 stays 0.
press 200 756
wait 400
press 70 494
press 200 494
press 330 494
press 70 582
wait 500
wait "text" "," 3000
press 200 582
press 330 582
press 70 669
wait 800
# Backspace across the separator.
press 330 756
wait 400
press 330 756
wait 400
press 330 756
wait 400
press 330 756
wait 600
# Fill to the 11-digit cap and beyond.
press 200 669
press 330 669
press 200 756
press 70 494
press 200 494
press 330 494
press 70 582
press 200 582
press 330 582
press 70 669
press 200 669
press 330 669
wait 1000
# Long-press backspace resets to 0.
longpress 330 756 800
wait 1200
# Rapid typing then rapid backspacing past zero.
press 330 669 --count 8
wait 300
press 330 756 --count 12
wait 1000
press 70 494
press 200 756
press 200 756
press 200 756
wait 800
longpress 330 756 800
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
